WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.397
Use a simple decision process.

00:00:02.397 --> 00:00:07.372
If category values need to become columns, use a pivot pattern.

00:00:07.372 --> 00:00:12.507
If repeated columns need to become rows, use an un pivot pattern.

00:00:12.507 --> 00:00:18.057
If categories change frequently, long form is usually more flexible.

00:00:18.057 --> 00:00:24.932
If categories are stable and the output is a fixed matrix, wide form may be appropriate.

00:00:24.932 --> 00:00:31.309
And whenever multiple source rows map to one output cell, make the aggregation rule explicit.
